    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 345,
        "endIndex": 469,
        "text": "Fei-Fei Li’s spatial-intelligence AI startup, World Labs, in an all-stock transaction valued at approximately $8.2 billion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 607,
        "endIndex": 614,
        "text": "Lisa Su"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 616,
        "endIndex": 765,
        "text": "* **Important Caveats:** The deal is subject to customary regulatory approvals and closing conditions, with completion anticipated by the end of 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 873,
        "endIndex": 1065,
        "text": "### **[0] Anthropic Launches Claude Sonnet 5.5**\n* **Editorial Scope:** **IN SCOPE** (AI Models / Product Release)\n* **What is Confirmed:** Anthropic announced the release of Claude Sonnet 5.5"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1067,
        "endIndex": 1202,
        "text": "The model delivers a 30%+ generation speed improvement over Sonnet 5, achieves 70.6% on the Terminal-Bench 4.0 agentic coding benchmark"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1067,
        "endIndex": 1300,
        "text": "The model delivers a 30%+ generation speed improvement over Sonnet 5, achieves 70.6% on the Terminal-Bench 4.0 agentic coding benchmark, and maintains API pricing at $2.00 per million input tokens and $10.00 per million output tokens"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1302,
        "endIndex": 1543,
        "text": "* **Important Caveats:** Anthropic’s system card notes that while Sonnet 5.5 shows improved agentic coding and reasoning, it does not cross new Responsible Scaling Policy (RSP) capability thresholds, though cyber safeguards have been added"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1636,
        "endIndex": 2006,
        "text": "### **[8] OpenAI Proposes \"Safety Case\" Framework for Frontier Training**\n* **Editorial Scope:** **IN SCOPE** (AI Policy & Safety Governance)\n* **What is Confirmed:** OpenAI published *\"Towards Safety Cases for Frontier AI Training\"*, introducing an internal governance and documentation framework modeled after safety-critical industries like aviation and nuclear power"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2008,
        "endIndex": 2197,
        "text": "The framework mandates structured safety documentation, executive veto authority, and automated/manual safety triggers before initiating high-level reinforcement learning (RL) training runs"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
